261	///
262	/// Use this to mark when components are:
263	/// - `WorkInProgress`: Still being designed or are partially implemented.
264	/// - `EngineeringReady`: Ready to be implemented.
265	/// - `Deprecated`: No longer recommended for use.
266	///
